+# Controlled Canic feedback qualification — 2026-09-09
+
+Canic owns the full evidence and hashes in its sibling checkout at
+`docs/audits/reports/2026-09/2026-09-09/toko-feedback.md` and
+`toko-feedback-evidence/manifest.json`. This is a scoped downstream handoff,
+not a publication or staging-apply receipt. The source snapshot precedes
+concurrent gameplay edits and uses Canic 0.110.13 / IcyDB 0.257.3.
+
+- CANIC-149: all 27 physical identities retained, old user data wiped, same caller
+  re-enrolled with new identity, completed replay preserves the new robot and
+  membership. Lost install reply, pre-Root interruption and Store outage recover
+  with three exact infrastructure installs total. Full Vite dispatch is not
+  included; shell contracts cover acknowledgement ordering.
+- CANIC-148/153: ordinary all-role coverage passes after Translation startup.
+  Real 64-entity/194-row maximum is 22,151,949 instructions, above 20,000,000.
+  Allocation experiment reaches 21,745,176 and is not adopted. A rejected source
+  stops the published Canic sampling timer; the Canic candidate changes rejection
+  to a retryable completion. All eight timer-authority cases and the real
+  64→65→64 sequence on all three Game Shards pass against the candidate.
+- CANIC-139: clean candidate first build 355.98s; eight verified hits 3.40s;
+  26,768 source inventory entries unchanged. The historical failed invocation
+  lacks retained before/after evidence; changed-role reuse remains open.
+- CANIC-154–159: 24 retained pool assets captured beyond the original seed;
+  same-operation interrupted recovery/conservation/replay pass. Root code 66
+  is lost by Coordinator's wait filter; the upstream candidate fixes the
+  Accepted-phase origin without blocking publication. Full live staging and
+  all funding-tranche cases remain open.
+
+Staging preparation review digest:
+`aecbab3d33f9a1247cc46e3c4610901d61ddaa91d902cd6c063d36a871265283`.
+Proposed actions stop Coordinator and stop/start Root. The review records
+zero new funding, 458.841T observed controlled, 219T maximum burn and 239.841T
+expected remaining. No preparation effect ran. The subsequent full reset and
+funding review cannot be approved before it exists.
